    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements </strong>You are wielding a weapon with the two-hand trait or a weapon that requires 1+ hands to use.</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You position your weapon in such a way that you can interact with your Diviner’s Deck with ease while wielding it. While you are in this stance, you can make two-handed Strikes with the required weapon while holding your cards in one hand. You bypass the need to adjust your grip as part of your Strikes.</p>"
